Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}The Decision to Stay
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 21
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.38,0:12:16.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.29,0:00:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,In my lifetime, I’ve seen plenty of betrayal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.52,0:00:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But Wolffy and Jay
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.52,0:00:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,have been fiercely loyal to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.48,0:00:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only have they repaired my car time and again,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.52,0:00:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,but this time, they even recovered my most prized weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.99,0:00:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But, Boss,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.82,0:00:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,have you forgotten about the traitor Weslie?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.78,0:00:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,They used to be companions.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.54,0:00:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I possibly be in cahoots with that little goat?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.62,0:00:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It was just a transaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.82,0:00:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I took three bottles of water from him—that’s all—in exchange for protecting him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.00,0:01:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, am I about to be found out?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.40,0:01:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Well said. You show integrity as clients
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.12,0:01:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,and loyalty as subordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.40,0:01:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on, everyone should look to them as role models.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.43,0:01:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us join hands to create a glorious future for Blue Planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.27,0:01:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Create a glorious future for Blue Planet! Create a glorious future for Blue Planet!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.75,0:01:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Create a glorious future for Blue Planet!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.82,0:01:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Here is the reward for this time—keep up the good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.50,0:01:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to tell Weslie.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.06,0:01:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That monster has appeared in this world again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.57,0:01:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss’s flatbread is really delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.33,0:01:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, you can have mine too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.56,0:01:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren’t you going to eat, Wolffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.00,0:01:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to leave; take good care of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.72,0:01:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.44,0:02:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I never told you, but I’m actually not from this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.07,0:02:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.59,0:02:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.51,0:02:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.31,0:02:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,With that stuffed-toy body of yours, it’s obvious you’re different from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.06,0:02:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Fair enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.86,0:02:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I come from a place called Green Green Grassland
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.82,0:02:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,A rift
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.13,0:02:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,A rift just like this one
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.29,0:02:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind, you wouldn’t understand anyway
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.29,0:02:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I do understand; I’ve seen a rift like this
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.04,0:02:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.60,0:02:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You…you’ve seen it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.20,0:02:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,When I was cleaning the screws,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.28,0:02:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I happened to see a rift like this
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.91,0:02:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,marked on the map in the cockpit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.35,0:02:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.51,0:02:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Come and help!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.82,0:03:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy, let’s get out of here quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.58,0:03:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re done for if Boss catches us trespassing in the cockpit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.85,0:03:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.00,0:03:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The map…the map…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.61,0:03:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Please enter the password.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.84,0:03:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Only Boss knows these passwords.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.71,0:03:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s get out of here before Boss finds us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.35,0:03:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing in my cockpit?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.01,0:03:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re just cleaning up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.34,0:03:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.30,0:03:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, get in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.94,0:03:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re done for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.93,0:03:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at what they’ve done.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.05,0:03:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We can explain this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.80,0:04:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, they take the initiative to find work
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.76,0:04:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,and actively clean up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.40,0:04:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Whereas you lot just eat and play; you show no initiative at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.31,0:04:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You really ought to learn from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.71,0:04:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s just something we ought to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.86,0:04:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s a mission now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.50,0:04:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The base is running low on water, so we need to fetch some from a nearby town.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.14,0:04:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Who’s going?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.25,0:04:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Fetching water…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.49,0:04:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy, Jay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.13,0:04:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time there’s a mission, you’re the first to step up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.53,0:04:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This time’s Outstanding Employees…I trust there’s no more dispute now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.20,0:04:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss is brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.48,0:04:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss, how do we get this water?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.28,0:04:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s simple: go to a nearby town and mention my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.60,0:04:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You can just take the water directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.96,0:04:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Easy. Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.35,0:04:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I can use this chance to slip out and meet Weslie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.35,0:04:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And fill him in on the situation here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.83,0:04:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent work. I’m going to reward you handsomely.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.61,0:05:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy, do you know that getting the water—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.73,0:05:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t talk about that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.57,0:05:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,My stomach hurts; I can’t hold it in anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.44,0:05:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it that urgent?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.04,0:05:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m going to relieve myself; wait for me in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.47,0:05:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie was supposed to be waiting for me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.99,0:05:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t attack; he’s a friend of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.82,0:05:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my god, why are you with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.50,0:05:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.34,0:05:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s fine; I made a deal with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.10,0:05:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,She’s injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.22,0:05:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I help her find the antidote to heal her eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.89,0:05:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,she’ll lead us to the rift and escort Xiao Mei to where she wants to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.09,0:05:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What if she goes back on her word after she’s healed?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.00,0:06:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what, I want to save her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.44,0:06:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.56,0:06:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up! Pull them apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.32,0:06:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go of me, Wolffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.32,0:06:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.23,0:06:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand your thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.31,0:06:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like how you refused to give up on me back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.99,0:06:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But no matter the outcome,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.98,0:06:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I will support you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.90,0:06:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.66,0:06:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I can’t leave just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.50,0:06:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I heard there’s a map inside Cha Erlang’s war chariot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.61,0:06:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It shows the location of the rift.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.01,0:06:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.65,0:06:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Cha Erlang trusts me a lot right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.77,0:06:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m sure I’ll be able to get the rift map and the antidote soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.12,0:06:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.80,0:06:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t—don’t hit me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.12,0:06:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.12,0:06:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw you didn’t bring any toilet paper, so I came to bring you some.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.94,0:06:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is Jay here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.83,0:06:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.47,0:06:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry, he’s…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.87,0:06:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,…one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.39,0:07:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, right, right. I’m on your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.59,0:07:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I won’t say a word. I promise to keep it a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.46,0:07:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re off to fetch some water now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.62,0:07:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll find a way to contact you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.53,0:07:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy, fetching water is really dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.05,0:07:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should go back and get some backup?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.65,0:07:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Dangerous?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.00,0:07:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s dangerous about it? I’ve weathered all kinds of storms.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.92,0:07:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.22,0:07:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a close call. So, “fetching water” actually means fighting for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.66,0:07:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn’t you tell me sooner?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.78,0:07:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You said you’d seen all kinds of storms.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.86,0:07:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you had some kind of ace up your sleeve.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.62,0:07:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously, why can’t we just be like everyone else
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.45,0:07:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,and trade normally with the water station?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.65,0:08:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is nothing but purple sand, with only a few oases.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.81,0:08:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And they’re all controlled by different warlords.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.44,0:08:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,These warlords control different resources.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.80,0:08:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Some towns are focused on entertainment, while others produce resources.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.19,0:08:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But the vital water supply is held by a major warlord named Guangzong.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.71,0:08:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But Boss and the Lords are sworn enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.26,0:08:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss asked why the Lords should have a monopoly on all those resources.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.26,0:08:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He absolutely refuses to engage in unfair deals with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.89,0:08:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s why we have to seize whatever supplies we need by force.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.01,0:08:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, didn’t Boss send people to capture Xiao Mei earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.93,0:08:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,If he’s at odds with the Lords, why did he take the bounty to catch her?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.13,0:08:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Because Boss wants to use Xiao Mei as leverage to negotiate with the Lords.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.45,0:08:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He wants to trade her for a territory with water resources.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.80,0:08:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So that we, his subordinates, can have water to drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.36,0:08:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But the Lords definitely won’t agree to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.52,0:08:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I think Boss is bound to clash with those Lords sooner or later.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.27,0:09:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I never expected that—you usually look so dazed, but it turns out you’re a walking encyclopedia.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.39,0:09:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,My benefactor said that people ought to work hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.43,0:09:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,So, I’ve always been working hard
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.46,0:09:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,to become Cha Erlang’s right-hand man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.14,0:09:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Your benefactor was right; keep up the good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.81,0:09:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ve finally arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.33,0:09:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s the purple desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.44,0:09:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy, we’re here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.44,0:09:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That is an unknown world; you must be extremely careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.88,0:09:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry, Mr. Slowy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.12,0:09:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll let you know if there’s any news.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.79,0:09:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s so hot here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.35,0:09:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there; we’ll find them soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.74,0:09:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Just think—if we rescue Weslie and Wolffy this time,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.66,0:09:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,we’ll become the main characters too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.72,0:10:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Who goes there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.96,0:10:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Daring to trespass on the Lord’s territory…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.00,0:10:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The Lord’s territory?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.91,0:10:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.02,0:10:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Seize them at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.54,0:10:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait—what if we refuse?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.65,0:10:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are the people in this world so impulsive?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.69,0:10:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Our food!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.16,0:10:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We accidentally dropped our backpacks into the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.80,0:11:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn’t matter; we can still do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.19,0:11:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.23,0:11:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me show you what the protagonist is capable of.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.66,0:11:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Check out this invention Mr. Slowy gave me: the Daydream Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.89,0:11:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Paddi, your gear is impressive too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.20,0:11:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do more of them keep appearing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.60,0:11:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t be afraid; I’m here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.75,0:11:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.26,0:12:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Guangzong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.93,0:12:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you’re the ones causing trouble in my territory.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
